  "title": "Your Journey Through Darkwind",
  "intro": [
    "A stage-by-stage walkthrough from your first steps to seasoned adventurer. Each stage is its own short help page -- read them as your character grows, not all at once."
  ],
  "guidance": [
    "At every stage: play at play.darkwind.ai for the live map and panels (help client), browse all topics with help list, and report anything odd with bug, idea, or typo."
  ],
  "guideDocId": "helpdir/new/guide",
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "stage1",
      "number": 1,
      "title": "Your First Minutes",
      "levelRange": null,
      "paragraphs": [
        "A short tutorial starts automatically for new characters and teaches looking, moving, gear, and safe combat. Darkflow shows it in a hover window. Type tutorial to see your current step and tutorial continue to continue in any client.",
        "Learn to look at everything (xa <thing>), check your inventory, and read your score. If you ever get lost, ncot returns you to the Center of Town, and the Newbie Tome Dispenser there (pull lever, read tome) holds the town directions."
      ],
      "commands": [
        "tutorial",
        "tutorial continue",
        "xa <thing>",
        "inventory",
        "score",
        "ncot",
        "pull lever",
        "read tome"
      ],
      "relatedTopics": [
