    {
      "id": "stage2",
      "number": 2,
      "title": "Gear Up and Learn to Fight",
      "levelRange": "levels 1-5",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Erga's newbie store (from the Center of Town: 4w, s) hands out free equipment fit for anyone under level 5; the donation room (5n, e) has castoffs from generous veterans. Wear and wield everything, then practice on the newbie farm.",
        "Death carries NO penalty at level 5 and under, so this is the time to take risks and learn kill, assess, and wimpy. Ask questions freely on the newbie channel -- everyone started here."
      ],
      "commands": [
        "kill",
        "assess",
        "wimpy"
      ],
