    {
      "id": "stage4",
      "number": 4,
      "title": "See the World",
      "levelRange": "levels 5-30",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The world is far bigger than town. The areas command catalogs every region with level ranges; characters up to level 10 already know the newbie-area wayshards, so touch shard networks open fast travel as you explore. Pick up quests for structured goals and bonus experience.",
        "Above level 5 death starts to cost 10% of your experience on hand -- your corpse keeps your gear, the church will whisk you back, and other players can avenge you to restore what you lost."
      ],
      "commands": [
        "areas",
        "touch shard"
      ],
