    {
      "id": "stage5",
      "number": 5,
      "title": "Money and Craft",
      "levelRange": null,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Coins pile up: open a bank account early -- auction bids and some purchases are backed by bank liens, and your balance is shared across every branch.",
        "Learn the player-driven economy: shops, the remote market, and the live auction channel. When you want a break from fighting, professions like fishing, mining, and smithing earn steadily and feed the market."
      ],
