    {
      "id": "stage6",
      "number": 6,
      "title": "Find Your People",
      "levelRange": null,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Darkwind is social. Channels connect the whole game; parties share the fight and the spoils; clans are player-run organizations with wars and coffers; kingdoms crown player rulers with their own nobility.",
        "Pick a divine patron when the gods start to notice you -- alignment and devotion open their own doors."
