    {
      "id": "stage7",
      "number": 7,
      "title": "Sharpen the Blade",
      "levelRange": "levels 30-100",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Mid-game is about power and polish: track your buffs and debuffs, hunt boss monsters and invasions, brave the eternal dungeon, duel in the arena, and chase achievements, daily rewards, and leaderboard rank.",
        "Unique weapons and armour -- one copy in the whole game -- are out there for the claiming."
