    {
      "id": "stage8",
      "number": 8,
      "title": "Renown and Rebirth",
      "levelRange": "level 100 and beyond",
      "paragraphs": [
        "At level 100 your level becomes renown -- HERO, ADV, or VILN by your deeds. Level 150 makes you a LEGEND and unlocks a free additional multichar slot. New mythic multichar registration is disabled.",
        "At 250 the true endgame opens: remort, a rebirth that trades your level for permanent boon points and starts the climb again, stronger each cycle. Specialization and the metaphysician path round out a veteran's power."
      ],
